  "visual_inspection": "runs/20261007-companion-priority/pbps-real-root-unique62/visual.inspection.json",
  "graph_delta": "Two public compiled positive REAL scalar root uniqueness declarations; zero private providers. SAME actual PBPS T/D consumer, with ALL alternative positive same-square roots independent of energy premises. Four affected module graph artifacts and two enriched module cards; older canonical metadata preserved. Joint GammaP/ontoM/typed Gram remains current claimed63 work, not a compiled dependency.",
  "preserved_canonical_cards": 67,
  "unrelated_emitted_paths": 84,
  "remaining": "Exported real scalar uniqueness and genuine original-input same defect/root only. Printed joint GammaP/ontoM/typed B*B, centered order/inverse/polar/H1/dynamics/main/cost/composition remain separate. Reader seal/main/live/postmerge purification and whole Goal remain open.",
  "sole_stabilization_owner": "ASTIS-SA-20261005-SPHMCImplementedPhaseKernel",
